# Build context control. Without this the context is 8.3 GB and includes 1.1 GB of
# TERMS-GATED model weights. The Dockerfiles only COPY Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, crates/,
# vendor/speakrs/ and scripts/, so nothing below is needed to build.
#
# Allowlist, not denylist: gated weights must never reach a published image, and a
# denylist silently fails open the moment someone adds a new directory. Everything is
# excluded, then the five build inputs are added back.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!scripts/
# vendor/ is gitignored but IS a build input: speakrs is a path dependency, and
# fixtures/test.wav is baked in as the provisioning smoke clip.
!vendor/speakrs/

# Re-exclude heavy or irrelevant subtrees of the paths added back above.
vendor/speakrs/.git/
vendor/speakrs/target/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
